  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.7.0 preserves pending Microsoft static coverage hits when a managed child terminates with an unhandled exception.\nThe test command adds an embedded startup hook that flushes the active collector's real counters before termination, while preserving existing startup hooks, the original exception and process exit.\nIncludes real MSTest startup coverage checks for the built tool and public native package. No source rewrites, exclusions, count adjustments or CLI exit-code changes.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.7.0.md",
